<title>USA: Armco Inc Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Armco Inc Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.05		    $0.02</p>
<p> Net			  9,400		    6,900</p>
<p> Revs		     441,300		  430,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 106,700		  106,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 includes a gain of $2 million for partial settlement of business interruption claim.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 includes gains totaling $10.5 million to recognize previously deferred gains from the sale of certain assets and the partial settlement of a business interruption insurance claim.</p>
<p>Net income prior to the payment of preferred dividends.</p>
</text>
